---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Why Is Your Competitor Getting the Calls You Should Be Getting?"
  description="Most local businesses are invisible on Google Maps because their Business Profile is incomplete. Get a free 12-hour analysis and find out exactly why your competitors are outranking you."
  ogTitle="Why Is Your Competitor Getting Your Calls? | zeisWorks"
  ogDescription="Find out exactly why your competitors outrank you in local search. Free 12-hour analysis. No call required."
  ogImage="/og-competitor-gap.png"
>

<style>
  /* ── Layout ── */
  .cg-page { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.75; }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .cg-hero {
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .cg-hero-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cg-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cg-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cg-h1 em { color: var(--orange); font-style: italic; }
  .cg-subhead {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* ── Form card ── */
  .cg-form-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }
  .cg-form-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cg-form-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }
  .cg-form-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cg-field { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .cg-field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }
  .cg-field input,
  .cg-field textarea,
  .cg-field select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
    border: 1.5px solid #E0DBD0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--cream);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .cg-field input:focus,
  .cg-field textarea:focus,
  .cg-field select:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--navy);
  }
  .cg-field textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 80px; }
  .cg-btn-submit {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .cg-btn-submit:hover { background: var(--terra-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .cg-form-trust {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink-light);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ── Success state ── */
  .cg-success {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .cg-success-icon {
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    background: var(--forest-light);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
  }
  .cg-success-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: var(--forest-mid); fill: none; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .cg-success h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .cg-success p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7; }

  /* ── Social proof strip ── */
  .cg-proof {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e3d8;
  }
  .cg-proof-inner { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cg-proof-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;
  }
  .cg-proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .cg-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .cg-proof-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e8e3d8;
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
  }
  .cg-proof-quote {
    font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem; font-style: italic;
  }
  .cg-proof-name { font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .cg-proof-title { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); }

  /* ── What you get ── */
  .cg-what {
    background: #f2ede4;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8e3d8;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e3d8;
  }
  .cg-what-inner { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cg-what-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .cg-what-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .cg-deliverables { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .cg-deliverables { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .cg-deliverable {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e8e3d8;
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cg-deliverable-title { font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .cg-deliverable-desc { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.65; }

  /* ── Final CTA ── */
  .cg-cta {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cg-cta-inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cg-cta h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.125rem); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .cg-cta p { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .cg-cta-btn {
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .cg-cta-btn:hover { background: #a8481a; transform: translateY(-1px); }
</style>

<div class="cg-page">

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <section class="cg-hero">
    <div class="cg-hero-inner">
      <p class="cg-eyebrow">Free · No call required · Results in 12 hours</p>
      <h1 class="cg-h1">Why is your competitor<br>getting the calls<br><em>you should be getting?</em></h1>
      <p class="cg-subhead">
        Most local businesses are invisible on Google Maps because their Business Profile is incomplete.
        I'll run a free 12-hour analysis on your business and show you exactly why your competitors
        are outranking you — and what to fix first.
      </p>

      <!-- Form card -->
      <div class="cg-form-card">
        <p class="cg-form-label">Get your free analysis</p>
        <p class="cg-form-title">Submit your business. Get answers.</p>
        <p class="cg-form-desc">Takes 2 minutes. Results in your inbox within 12 hours.</p>

        <!-- Netlify form (hidden detection copy) -->
        <form name="campaign-competitor-gap" netlify netlify-honeypot="bot-field" hidden>
          <input type="text" name="name" />
          <input type="email" name="email" />
          <input type="text" name="business_name" />
          <input type="url" name="website" />
          <textarea name="description"></textarea>
          <input type="text" name="how_found" />
        </form>

        <!-- Visible form -->
        <form
          id="cg-form"
          name="campaign-competitor-gap"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          action="/campaign/competitor-gap/thank-you"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="campaign-competitor-gap" />
          <p class="hidden" style="display:none">
            <label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <div class="cg-field">
            <label for="cg-name">Your name</label>
            <input type="text" id="cg-name" name="name" placeholder="Jane Smith" required />
          </div>
          <div class="cg-field">
            <label for="cg-email">Email address</label>
            <input type="email" id="cg-email" name="email" placeholder="jane@yourbusiness.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="cg-field">
            <label for="cg-biz">Business name</label>
            <input type="text" id="cg-biz" name="business_name" placeholder="Acme Plumbing Co." required />
          </div>
          <div class="cg-field">
            <label for="cg-url">Website URL</label>
            <input type="url" id="cg-url" name="website" placeholder="https://yourbusiness.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="cg-field">
            <label for="cg-desc">What do you do and who are your customers?</label>
            <textarea id="cg-desc" name="description" placeholder="e.g. HVAC repair and installation for homeowners in Denver, CO" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" name="how_found" value="campaign-competitor-gap" />

          <button type="submit" class="cg-btn-submit">Get my free analysis →</button>
          <p class="cg-form-trust">No sales call. No obligation. Just the analysis.</p>
        </form>

        <!-- Success state (shown via JS after AJAX submit) -->
        <div class="cg-success" id="cg-success">
          <div class="cg-success-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2>You're all set.</h2>
          <p>Your analysis request is in. I'll run the full audit and send results to your inbox within 12 hours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── SOCIAL PROOF ── -->
  <section class="cg-proof">
    <div class="cg-proof-inner">
      <p class="cg-proof-label">What clients say</p>
      <div class="cg-proof-grid">
        <div class="cg-proof-card">
          <p class="cg-proof-quote">"All of which have exceeded my expectations as a company leader."</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-name">Alex Zemianek</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-title">Owner & CEO, JZ Vacation Rentals</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-proof-card">
          <p class="cg-proof-quote">"Efficient, personable and dependable. He was easy to work with and a great asset to our team."</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-name">Verified Client</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-title">Upwork · 5.0 ★</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-proof-card">
          <p class="cg-proof-quote">"Thorough, accurate, and timely. I highly recommend him for any sales or operations work."</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-name">Ray Updyke</p>
          <p class="cg-proof-title">Alpaca VC · 254 hrs logged</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── WHAT YOU GET ── -->
  <section class="cg-what">
    <div class="cg-what-inner">
      <p class="cg-what-label">What's in the analysis</p>
      <h2 class="cg-what-title">A written report. Not a sales pitch.</h2>
      <div class="cg-deliverables">
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">Local Search Visibility Score</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">How your business ranks for your category and service area, benchmarked against your top 3–5 competitors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">Competitor Citation Map</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">Which competitors are being cited for your category and why. You'll see the gap clearly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">Specific Gaps Identified</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">Concrete problems — not vague recommendations. Missing profile fields, absent directories, service pages that don't convert.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">Quick Wins You Can Do Yourself</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">Fixes you can make this week without hiring anyone. GBP completeness, schema, FAQ structure — things that move fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">A Plan If It's Worth Pursuing</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">If there's a meaningful gap, I'll include a prioritized plan with options — what to do, what it costs, and what the ROI looks like.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cg-deliverable">
          <p class="cg-deliverable-title">No Call Required</p>
          <p class="cg-deliverable-desc">Results land in your inbox. If you want to talk, you can. If not, the report stands on its own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FINAL CTA ── -->
  <section class="cg-cta">
    <div class="cg-cta-inner">
      <h2>Stop losing calls to a competitor who just set up their profile better.</h2>
      <p>Submit your business above and I'll show you exactly what they're doing that you're not — and what it would take to flip the script.</p>
      <a href="#" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false;" class="cg-cta-btn">Get my free analysis →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('cg-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const success = document.getElementById('cg-success');

  if (form && success) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new URLSearchParams(new FormData(form) as any);
      try {
        await fetch('/', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
          body: data.toString(),
        });
        form.style.display = 'none';
        success.style.display = 'block';
        // Fire Meta Lead event
        if (typeof (window as any).fbq !== 'undefined') {
          (window as any).fbq('track', 'Lead', { content_name: 'campaign-competitor-gap' });
        }
        // Redirect to thank-you after brief delay
        setTimeout(() => {
          window.location.href = '/campaign/competitor-gap/thank-you';
        }, 1200);
      } catch {
        form.submit();
      }
    });
  }
</script>

</BaseLayout>
